	'k0e21b64a' => 'Marco Bellini, a team lead, took Presenting with Confidence and ran his first quarterly review without reading the slides. He used the lessons to prepare, then stood beside the table in the meeting room and spoke the review himself. The slides stayed in the room. He did not read them aloud.',
