	'k78386ec8' => 'People',
	'k784da443' => 'Hanna Lund, who was returning to work after parental leave, took this course and studied at the kitchen table after bedtime. That is her account of how she used the time. Access lasts 24 months from purchase, so the suggested 5 weeks can stretch when a week is already full.',
	'k786e3cc6' => 'Write to us',
	'k7929270a' => 'Say whether you have watched lesson 1, which is free, or already enrolled. For a refund, say how many lessons you have watched and the date of purchase, because the rule is 14 days and fewer than 3 lessons. For a team licence, say which courses you are asking about.',
	'k797600cc' => 'Ines founded Kaiten Skills in 2017 with Jonah Ellery and teaches this course.',
	'k7ae8d859' => 'Access lasts 24 months from purchase. During that time the lessons you bought stay available 24 hours a day, seven days a week. The 24 hours are about watching. They are not the hours when learner support is in the studio. Support answers Monday to Friday 09:00 to 18:00 CET and Saturday 10:00 to 14:00 CET. A suggested length of 4, 5, 6 or 16 weeks is shorter than 24 months on purpose, so a paused week does not end the course. Access is for that enrolment. It does not extend itself, and a refund is a different rule: 14 days, and fewer than 3 lessons watched. Email hello@kaiten-skills.example if a course you paid for will not open.',
	'k7b0d49a1' => 'The studio remains Kanaalstraat 21, 3531 Utrecht, Netherlands. You will not be booked into a seat there, because teaching happens in the lessons, at your table.',
	'k7bc21275' => 'The player',
	'k7e6c65bb' => 'Courses you are enrolled in',
	'k7ea7a3bb' => 'Checkout is in euros and enrols you straight away, with instant access to the lessons you bought. Access lasts 24 months from purchase. A refund is available within 14 days if fewer than 3 lessons were watched. The lessons remain online at any hour.',
	'k7ed5ebf2' => 'How do I buy a course and get access?',
	'k8004a9a1' => 'Watch lesson 1 before you decide is about the free first lesson on any of the six courses, before you pay €119, €129, €139, €149, €169 or €329. A notebook beside the laptop is about writing a few lines during the lesson, then sending practice if you want feedback within 5 working days. None of the notes promises an outcome.',
	'k80a28809' => 'Seven people',
	'k80d7c75b' => 'The top of My courses is a progress strip with three labels: In progress, Completed and Certificates. The numerals are yours. They count the courses you are still working through, the courses you have finished, and the certificates of completion attached to finished courses.',
	'k80f116c7' => 'When you finish a course you receive a certificate of completion. It records that you completed the enrolment. It is not an accredited qualification. Kaiten Skills does not present it as a diploma, a licence or a pass in a professional exam.',
	'k810d43b8' => 'No. It is a certificate of completion when you finish. It records the lessons done. It is not a diploma or a professional qualification.',
	'k81c68fe3' => 'Career Starter Bundle',
	'k820229a1' => 'Next lesson →',
	'k8279be1a' => 'If several people at one workplace need Clear Business Writing, Presenting with Confidence, Spreadsheets from Zero or another course, write to hello@kaiten-skills.example and say which courses and how you would like to enrol them. Lena Hoffmann leads learner support, and Jonah Ellery looks after the platform and learner support.',
	'k8314a22c' => 'Reports, teaches Reports People Actually Read: 20 lessons, 4 weeks, €139.',
	'k831a28f1' => 'Buy',
	'k8401ef20' => 'You send a short assignment taken from your own work.',
	'k84849de5' => 'Hours are Monday to Friday 09:00 to 18:00 CET and Saturday 10:00 to 14:00 CET.',
	'k860e27cf' => 'Five steps take you from a free first lesson to a certificate of completion. The rules for access, refunds and feedback are the same on every course.',
	'k87b1cb36' => 'All courses →',
	'k88a6a111' => 'Priya Raman, an operations assistant, took Spreadsheets from Zero and rebuilt her team\'s weekly stock sheet. She watched in the warehouse office, in gaps between other work, with the course on her laptop. She stayed with the grid the team already used until the weekly sheet was one they could follow.',
	'k89368e42' => 'Can my team buy licences?',
	'k8a72dd0d' => 'Finish with a certificate',
	'k8af0f5c3' => 'Learning',
	'k8aff4fa8' => 'Browse courses',
	'k8b705118' => 'Saturday',
	'k8bc227fe' => 'Studio',
	'k8c004d7e' => 'Practice',
	'k8cfddee5' => 'That is what she described: the place and the hour, not a measured change at work. A lesson of 8 to 14 minutes fitted after bedtime in a way a longer class would not. Access lasts 24 months, which matters when evenings disappear.',
	'k8d671a6c' => 'Choose a course, or watch lesson 1 free first. Then use Buy course on the archive or Enrol on the course page. Both take you to checkout. When payment is complete you are enrolled and access is instant. You do not wait for a start date, and you do not travel to the studio. Access lasts 24 months from that purchase. The Career Starter Bundle is a single checkout at €329 for 74 lessons, not three payments. If the course does not appear, email hello@kaiten-skills.example. Learner support is open Monday to Friday 09:00 to 18:00 CET and Saturday 10:00 to 14:00 CET. Jonah Ellery looks after the platform and learner support.',
	'k8f7f4c1c' => 'About',
	'k8f87e65f' => '4 weeks',
	'k92efaa85' => 'Presenting with Confidence',
	'k93bc3f8a' => 'Reports People Actually Read',
	'k94c51f19' => 'Bundle',
	'k94fdaba9' => 'My courses shows what you are still studying, what you have finished, and which certificates of completion are ready. The numerals on the strip are taken from your own enrolments.',
	'k96427a1d' => 'Choose a course',
	'k9720c37c' => 'Nothing here yet. Try the <a href="/courses/">courses</a>.',
	'k987b8c07' => 'If you need longer, access remains for 24 months from purchase. When you finish the course, you receive a certificate of completion. It is not an accredited qualification.',
	'k9885676f' => '24 lessons · 5 weeks · Ines Carvalho',
	'k9bb1303c' => 'How does assignment feedback work?',
	'k9c102aed' => 'The certificate of completion is issued when you finish the course. No other delay is published, and the 5 working days you may have seen elsewhere belong to assignment feedback, not to the certificate. When it is issued, find it on My courses under Certificates. The same strip shows In progress and Completed, so you can tell a finished course from one you are still watching. Access lasts 24 months, which is the time you have to reach the end of the lesson list. If you have finished and the list is empty, email hello@kaiten-skills.example. Lena Hoffmann leads learner support. Hours are Monday to Friday 09:00 to 18:00 CET and Saturday 10:00 to 14:00 CET.',
	'k9c35f3e6' => 'Courses include practice, and assignment feedback is returned within 5 working days. The five days are working days. They follow the support week, Monday to Friday, rather than a clock that runs through the night. Saturday hours, 10:00 to 14:00 CET, are for learner support, not a second feedback shift. The reply comes from the tutor of that course. Ines Carvalho teaches writing. Sofia Marín teaches reports. Tomasz Wierzba teaches presenting. Amara Osei teaches Spreadsheets from Zero. Rahul Menon teaches spreadsheet modelling. Send the assignment when you can. There is no live class to attend, and no walk-in hour at the studio. Your own notes on the lesson page are separate from work you submit for feedback.',
	'k9ef53ccd' => 'Hanna Lund',
	'k9fc77e0d' => 'Jonah Ellery',
	'k9ffdb952' => 'How it works',
	'ka1c2097e' => 'Course prices',
	'ka2ff52fb' => 'Finishing the enrolment produces a certificate of completion. It is not an accredited qualification. Access for the learner is 24 months from purchase. A refund remains available within 14 days if fewer than 3 lessons were watched.',
	'ka396b009' => 'Writing, presenting, spreadsheets and the bundle',
	'ka4ae8a71' => 'Spreadsheet modelling',
	'ka52ea1ef' => 'Kaiten Skills<br>Kanaalstraat 21<br>3531 Utrecht, Netherlands',
	'ka5a6fe19' => 'Before you enrol',
	'ka5a7a519' => 'The tone of a short reply',
	'ka5b73903' => 'Enrolled',
	'ka69f3469' => 'Ten answers, grouped as Buying, Learning and Certificates. Figures here match the course pages: the same prices, the same hours, the same refund rule.',
	'ka6a9de6e' => 'Use it for access that did not start after checkout, for a refund within 14 days if fewer than 3 lessons were watched, for a missing certificate of completion, and for a question about team licences. Assignment feedback is a different queue. Tutors return it within 5 working days, and it is not sent through a walk-in visit.',
	'ka6f039ad' => 'All tutors →',
	'ka7d9c59a' => 'The certificates list names each certificate of completion you have earned. It is issued when you finish that course. It is not an accredited qualification. The Career Starter Bundle is one enrolment of 74 lessons and a suggested length of 16 weeks. Finishing it is recorded for that enrolment.',
	'ka82c20c5' => 'Three learners describe how a course fitted an ordinary week. The journal beside them is about study habits, not about results we cannot know.',
	'ka863b7d4' => 'Who it is for',
	'ka9ffcb0e' => 'Kaiten Skills is an online school for writing, presenting and spreadsheets, the work you already do at a desk. Ines Carvalho and Jonah Ellery started it in 2017 from a studio at Kanaalstraat 21 in Utrecht. Lessons run 8 to 14 minutes, so they fit around a job. The studio is for recording, not for a class you travel to.',
	'kaa762470' => 'Clear Business Writing · lesson 1 of 24',
	'kaaea94fb' => 'Each card carries the lesson count, the suggested length and the price on one line, then Buy course, which takes you to checkout. After purchase, access lasts 24 months. A refund is available within 14 days if fewer than 3 lessons were watched.',
	'kad574c1e' => 'Learner support, 10:00 to 14:00 CET.',
	'kaec83afa' => 'The certificate appears under Certificates on My courses, next to the counts for In progress and Completed. The Career Starter Bundle is one enrolment of 74 lessons. Completing it is recorded for that bundle, not as three extra awards.',
	'kaeda294f' => 'Try lesson 1 free',
	'kaee676a4' => 'Lesson list · 24 lessons',
	'kaf492031' => 'Every course opens with lesson 1 free, so you can judge the pace before you buy. Writing, presenting and spreadsheets are separate courses. The Career Starter Bundle joins Clear Business Writing, Presenting with Confidence and Spreadsheets from Zero. Choose the one skill you need.',
	'kaf96ab41' => 'Writing',
	'kb1397d18' => 'Lesson 1 · Welcome: who reads your writing',
	'kb13a1e1d' => 'Beside the three stories, the journal keeps three notes on study habits. They are not further results. Twelve minutes at the table is about fitting one lesson of 8 to 14 minutes into an evening, the way Hanna Lund studied after bedtime. The line we use is simple: twelve minutes a day is enough to start.',
	'kb2a14f38' => 'Finish the course and Kaiten Skills issues a certificate of completion.',
	'kb39a7288' => 'Short video courses in writing, presenting and spreadsheets.',
	'kb5ce95d0' => 'Sunday has no support hours. A lesson you already own can still be watched.',
	'kb6e0b0c9' => 'In progress',
	'kb848fb22' => 'The work since 2017 has been these courses, not a campus.',
	'kb8c7b17c' => 'Three courses, fitted into a real week.',
	'kb8f91a58' => 'Spreadsheets',
	'kb94ca76e' => '74 lessons · 16 weeks',
	'kb984e8d4' => 'Presenting, teaches Presenting with Confidence: 22 lessons, 5 weeks, €149.',
	'kbaa7ed6e' => 'Meet a tutor\'s course',
	'kbb9625c5' => 'hello@kaiten-skills.example',
	'kbbaff128' => 'Contact',
	'kbc055c84' => 'What to write about',
	'kbc24066a' => 'Is the certificate an accredited qualification?',
	'kbc95c043' => '24 lessons',
	'kbcc5f86f' => 'Five steps',
	'kbf9fb063' => '5 working days is the time allowed for assignment feedback to come back from the tutor. The five days are working days, Monday to Friday. They are not the time it takes to issue a certificate, and they are not support hours. Support is a separate clock: Monday to Friday 09:00 to 18:00 CET and Saturday 10:00 to 14:00 CET.',
	'kc08f0ce7' => 'Email us',
	'kc0963f06' => 'Prices are in EUR and do not change by language. Clear Business Writing, Ines Carvalho, 24 lessons, suggested length 5 weeks, €129. Reports People Actually Read, Sofia Marín, 20 lessons, 4 weeks, €139. Presenting with Confidence, Tomasz Wierzba, 22 lessons, 5 weeks, €149. Spreadsheets from Zero, Amara Osei, 28 lessons, 6 weeks, €119. Spreadsheet Models for Decisions, Rahul Menon, 26 lessons, 6 weeks, €169. The Career Starter Bundle has no single tutor. It joins Clear Business Writing, Presenting with Confidence and Spreadsheets from Zero: 74 lessons, a suggested 16 weeks, €329. Lessons are 8 to 14 minutes. Lesson 1 of every course is free. Team licences have no public price. Ask hello@kaiten-skills.example.',
	'kc2086cf2' => 'Certificate of completion',
	'kc2093722' => 'Read this story →',
	'kc2296fe5' => 'Access, refunds and feedback',
	'kc2ba67b8' => '22 lessons',
	'kc366a305' => 'Hanna Lund, returning to work after parental leave, took Clear Business Writing and studied at the kitchen table after bedtime. She opened the short lessons once the evening was quiet, tea beside the laptop. The writing she practised was the kind of note she expected to send again at work.',
	'kc442ac7e' => 'Spreadsheet modelling, teaches Spreadsheet Models for Decisions: 26 lessons, 6 weeks, €169.',
	'kc463c86d' => 'When is the certificate issued, and where do I find it?',
	'kc606dd6c' => '24 lessons · Ines Carvalho · 24 of 24 watched',
