	'kc7d7b082' => 'One skill',
	'kc80876ee' => 'Rahul Menon',
	'kc8483ede' => 'Team licences',
	'kc85d3778' => 'Learner stories',
	'kc85fd157' => 'Six courses, each built around a work skill you can practise at your own table. Filter by writing, presenting, spreadsheets or the bundle, then watch lesson 1 free.',
	'kc88f4d83' => 'Lesson',
	'kc8c99896' => 'Every course opens with lesson 1 free, so you can judge the pace before you buy.',
	'kc91c7b93' => 'Reports',
	'kc932f601' => 'How long is a lesson, and can I try lesson 1 free?',
	'kc97829c8' => 'The list beside the player shows the lessons in the course you are enrolled in. Clear Business Writing has 24. Reports People Actually Read has 20. Presenting with Confidence has 22. Spreadsheets from Zero has 28. Spreadsheet Models for Decisions has 26.',
	'kcbb37401' => 'Stories',
	'kcbdd08ba' => 'When this lesson ends, Next lesson takes you to the following item in the list. You do not have to start it in the same sitting.',
	'kcc44ea69' => 'Is the certificate accredited?',
	'kcc5fd9b9' => 'Send a message',
	'kcc8fe8bd' => 'Your notes for this lesson',
	'kccf40bf0' => 'Sofia Marín',
	'kcd82d6a9' => 'Each lesson lasts 8 to 14 minutes, for a kitchen table or a desk. The Utrecht studio holds no walk-in classes. Pause when the day interrupts, then open the next lesson when you can. One course is planned across 4, 5 or 6 weeks.',
	'kcdf0255a' => 'Next lesson',
	'kcec71fba' => 'Co-founder, platform and learner support, is not the named tutor of a course.',
	'kced5b6ba' => 'My courses',
	'kcf056113' => 'Learn at your own table, keep it at work.',
	'kd045fc2a' => 'Practise with feedback',
	'kd085c063' => 'Free · 09:40',
	'kd0fbda98' => 'Page not found',
	'kd356d8d1' => 'Support hours',
	'kd359c6df' => 'Form',
	'kd439af04' => 'Name the course if you have one. The six are Clear Business Writing at €129, Reports People Actually Read at €139, Presenting with Confidence at €149, Spreadsheets from Zero at €119, Spreadsheet Models for Decisions at €169, and the Career Starter Bundle at €329.',
	'kd53f015a' => 'Every lesson is 8 to 14 minutes. That includes lesson 1, which is free on every course, before you pay. The free lesson is the same kind of video as the rest, not a separate trailer with a different length. Clear Business Writing has 24 lessons, Reports People Actually Read 20, Presenting with Confidence 22, Spreadsheets from Zero 28, Spreadsheet Models for Decisions 26, and the Career Starter Bundle 74. Suggested lengths are 5, 4, 5, 6, 6 and 16 weeks, in that order. The suggestion is a pace. You can watch lesson 1 of more than one course before you choose. Enrolment and the 24 months of access begin only when you buy.',
	'kd554d9bf' => 'Your email',
	'kd62997ca' => 'You watch at your own table and use the same skill at work the same week. There are no walk-in classes. Lesson 1 of every course is free to watch. After purchase, access lasts 24 months. Learner support answers Monday to Friday, 09:00–18:00 CET, and Saturday, 10:00–14:00 CET.',
	'kd6c49f26' => 'Learner support, 09:00 to 18:00 CET.',
	'kd84b1157' => 'Ines Carvalho',
	'kd92e5117' => 'Lena Hoffmann',
	'kda36cfaf' => 'months',
	'kda4d1921' => 'Shape a report so a busy reader can finish it.',
	'kdb95d5b9' => 'Marco Bellini is a team lead. He took Presenting with Confidence, taught by Tomasz Wierzba. The course is 22 lessons, a suggested length of 5 weeks, priced at €149. Each lesson is 8 to 14 minutes. In his account, he ran his first quarterly review without reading slides.',
	'kdbeb5851' => 'Access from the day you buy, at any hour.',
	'kdcbf1a28' => 'A lesson opens in the player as one video of 8 to 14 minutes. That length is the same across Clear Business Writing, Reports People Actually Read, Presenting with Confidence, Spreadsheets from Zero, Spreadsheet Models for Decisions and the Career Starter Bundle.',
	'kdd2fa849' => 'Finish the course and Kaiten Skills issues a certificate of completion. It only records that you finished. It is not an accredited qualification and does not replace a diploma. You may replay lessons for the rest of the 24-month access.',
	'kde54018e' => 'Ines Carvalho · 9 min 40 · free to watch',
	'kdefbec51' => 'Each lesson lasts 8 to 14 minutes, for a kitchen table or a desk.',
	'kdf48426e' => 'The Career Starter Bundle lists no single tutor. It joins Ines\'s writing course, Tomasz\'s presenting course and Amara\'s Spreadsheets from Zero: 74 lessons, 16 weeks, €329.',
	'kdfba89a6' => 'Story',
	'kdfcde532' => 'When is learner support open, and when can I watch?',
	'ke00527be' => 'You send a short assignment taken from your own work. A tutor replies with written feedback within 5 working days. That reply is not a grade and not an accredited qualification. If a question falls outside the assignment, learner support answers during the posted hours.',
	'ke16336e3' => 'Priya Raman',
	'ke22ac25b' => 'Pricing',
	'ke275ce00' => 'Six courses, one skill each.',
	'ke2b9444a' => 'Email hello@kaiten-skills.example or use the form on this page. The studio is in Utrecht, and it does not hold walk-in classes.',
	'ke4eef549' => 'Refund within 14 days if fewer than 3 lessons were watched. Access lasts 24 months from purchase. Assignment feedback arrives within 5 working days. The certificate marks completion, not an accredited qualification.',
	'ke51654ae' => 'A course is built in four stages, and then it is left as a set of short lessons you can buy.',
	'ke6cbeefa' => 'You send an assignment, and that tutor replies within 5 working days.',
	'ke73a85a2' => 'Practise, and receive assignment feedback within 5 working days. Finish with a certificate of completion. That certificate is not an accredited qualification. Learner support can help with access or a refund at hello@kaiten-skills.example, Monday to Friday 09:00 to 18:00 CET and Saturday 10:00 to 14:00 CET.',
	'ke8f057c7' => 'Tomasz Wierzba',
	'kea1a67d5' => 'The school was founded in 2017. Classes are online. The studio at Kanaalstraat 21, 3531 Utrecht, Netherlands does not hold walk-in sessions.',
	'keb0f48a1' => 'Certificate',
	'keb8899f0' => 'There is no separate timetable of named modules beyond those lessons, and no cohort start date. Between lessons you practise, and assignment feedback is returned within 5 working days. The suggested length of 5 weeks is a way to spread the 24 lessons, not a deadline.',
	'ked0e2e80' => 'From a free lesson to a certificate.',
