	'kef1e6887' => 'Audience',
	'kf0a9f99a' => 'Cutting a paragraph in half',
	'kf100c25b' => 'It is for someone who writes as part of the working day and wants one course on that skill, taught by Ines Carvalho, rather than a mixed programme.',
	'kf15e2cf3' => 'Clear Business Writing is taught by Ines Carvalho, co-founder of Kaiten Skills, whose subject is writing. The course has 24 lessons and a suggested length of 5 weeks. The price is €129. Each lesson runs 8 to 14 minutes. Lesson 1 is free to watch.',
	'kf1f5e96f' => 'Amara Osei',
	'kf2108f78' => 'Learner support is open Monday to Friday, 09:00 to 18:00 CET, and Saturday, 10:00 to 14:00 CET. Lessons are available 24 hours a day, including when no one is answering mail. The email is hello@kaiten-skills.example.',
	'kf2dc1983' => 'They are recorded to run 8 to 14 minutes, with lesson 1 free on every course.',
